WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:02.135
Behind every house in storefront burn.

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:03.670
There is, of course, a story.

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:04.137
A family

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:05.638
who lost a home full of memories,

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:06.339
a business owner

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:07.640
whose years of hard work

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.743
literally went up in flames.

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:12.545
And my next guest suffered that loss.

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:13.713
Iconic artist

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:15.882
Ruby Maze are best known for this.

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:18.251
The first mouth and tongue

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:20.787
ever created for the Rolling Stones,

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:22.022
which was featured

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:23.089
prominently

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:24.657
on the Tumbling Dice record

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:26.793
sleeve back in 1971.

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:28.495
He was about to open a new gallery

00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:30.163
on Front Street in Lahaina.

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:32.632
100 of his paintings were lost.

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:35.535
And Ruby joins me now

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:38.371
Ruby, thanks so much for taking the time

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:39.005
to talk to us.

00:00:39.005 --> 00:00:40.373
And we're so sorry

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:42.008
for everything you've lost.

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:44.844
Can you explain what happened Tuesday

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:46.379
when the fires began?

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:47.747
I know you were at home

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:49.182
in a different community in Maui.

00:00:49.182 --> 00:00:50.850
Your sons were at your gallery

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.052
on Front Street in Lahaina

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:53.753
preparing for its grand opening, right?

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:56.189
Correct.

00:00:56.189 --> 00:00:58.591
Yeah, it was.

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:00.260
We've been waiting for this

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:01.861
Maui location,

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:04.164
which is right next to Fleetwoods.

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:06.332
And when we found it,

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:06.833
we moved

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:10.003
the gallery from Waikiki over to Maui.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.138
So we shipped over

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:14.074
a hundred paintings here.

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:16.443
I live up in Kula upcountry

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:20.447
And my three sons have been working

00:01:20.447 --> 00:01:22.215
in the track lighting

00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:23.983
and the painting in the building

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:25.485
and the furniture

00:01:25.485 --> 00:01:27.053
and hanging the paintings.

00:01:27.053 --> 00:01:29.322
And we decided, Okay,

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:30.957
we're going to be ready

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:33.660
Tuesday for the grand opening.

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.762
And Monday night,

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:38.364
they were in the gallery

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:39.165
and people

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:40.233
coming in already

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:41.801
and saying, Oh, I want to buy this.

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:43.269
I want to buy this.

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:44.771
And my son said, You know what?

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:47.006
My dad's going to be here tomorrow night.

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:49.709
You bought from him before.

00:01:49.709 --> 00:01:50.743
He would love to

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:54.481
say hello to you and wish you happiness

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:55.682
and whatever

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:57.984
Come back tomorrow for the grand opening.

00:01:57.984 --> 00:01:59.586
And they said, no, we want to buy it now.

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:01.421
And they said, No, no, tomorrow.

00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:04.524
So they said, Okay.

00:02:04.524 --> 00:02:05.892
And

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:08.928
the next day I was up at my house

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:10.096
and the winds were like

00:02:10.096 --> 00:02:11.364
100 miles per hour.

00:02:11.364 --> 00:02:16.002
And I have £150 mass of a good bear walk.

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:20.607
And my son's called and said, Dad, it's

00:02:20.607 --> 00:02:22.442
really getting bad.

00:02:22.442 --> 00:02:24.444
I said, Well,

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:25.011
better

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:25.612
come on

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:26.279
back here,

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:26.846
because it's

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:29.749
not looking good here either.

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:30.817
And they came up.

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:33.353
They tried to get out of Lahaina,

00:02:34.053 --> 00:02:34.587
and they were

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:36.356
closing down the road

00:02:36.356 --> 00:02:38.925
because of the flames,

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:41.394
and they got out.

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:45.098
But it was a miracle they got out.

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:48.701
They came up to my house

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:51.137
and they saw all the furniture, my deck,

00:02:51.137 --> 00:02:52.472
everything was being

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:55.341
thrown around like toothpicks.

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:57.577
And they go, Dad, we got to go now.

00:02:58.111 --> 00:02:59.279
And I said, you know what?

00:03:00.847 --> 00:03:01.848
If it's going to be

00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:04.517
really bad, let's get a hotel room.

00:03:05.952 --> 00:03:09.489
Not one hotel had a room available.

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:10.290
Nothing.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:14.427
We were calling 15 hotels, not one room.

00:03:15.295 --> 00:03:17.430
So my other son said, You know what?

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:20.433
Let's get a U-Haul.

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:22.902
Look, okay,

00:03:22.902 --> 00:03:24.504
we got to you all.

00:03:24.504 --> 00:03:25.705
So we went to Walmart,

00:03:25.705 --> 00:03:27.040
bought blow up beds,

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:29.976
and then we had four dogs in the car.

00:03:31.578 --> 00:03:34.447
We'd walk to blow up beds, blankets,

00:03:34.447 --> 00:03:37.750
sheets, pillows, bottles of water.

00:03:38.484 --> 00:03:42.388
And we went to two U-Haul to the parking

00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:44.891
lot of the airport to sleep there.

00:03:46.259 --> 00:03:49.062
And the next thing we knew,

00:03:49.062 --> 00:03:51.397
Lino was gone.

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:53.900
I know it's completely gone.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:56.402
My lifelong work of 50

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:58.504
years, painting rockstars stars

00:03:59.606 --> 00:04:00.440
got

00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:03.276
and I've been having calls

00:04:03.276 --> 00:04:05.912
from people, collectors

00:04:05.912 --> 00:04:07.814
from all over the world.

00:04:07.814 --> 00:04:08.881
And last night,

00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:10.550
one collector called back and

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:11.417
she said, Ruby,

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:13.586
this painting

00:04:13.586 --> 00:04:14.087
we bought

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:15.655
from you a couple of years ago,

00:04:15.655 --> 00:04:17.857
we paid a lot of money for it.

00:04:17.857 --> 00:04:19.892
We'd like to send it back to you

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:22.262
so you could sell it and get some money.

00:04:22.762 --> 00:04:25.231
And people are amazing.

00:04:25.999 --> 00:04:28.268
Ruby, I can't imagine

00:04:28.268 --> 00:04:30.136
what it's like for you now.

00:04:30.136 --> 00:04:32.538
When you saw the images of Front Street,

00:04:32.939 --> 00:04:33.139
you know,

00:04:33.139 --> 00:04:35.141
not just your gallery in ruins, but

00:04:35.141 --> 00:04:37.010
but all your artwork gone,

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:38.978
what went through your mind?

00:04:39.145 --> 00:04:39.812
Well,

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.749
John, I just beat cancer

00:04:42.915 --> 00:04:45.318
for the third time.

00:04:46.252 --> 00:04:48.554
I had bladder cancer.

00:04:48.554 --> 00:04:49.822
I had a brain tumor.

00:04:49.822 --> 00:04:52.692
They gave me six months to live.

00:04:52.692 --> 00:04:53.860
And this last year,

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:56.062
I had a bout with throat cancer.

00:04:57.063 --> 00:04:59.299
So I figured if I could beat cancer

00:04:59.299 --> 00:05:01.934
three times, nothing can take me down.

00:05:02.902 --> 00:05:03.469
And then

00:05:03.469 --> 00:05:06.205
losing my life's work

00:05:07.573 --> 00:05:10.109
and almost losing my three sons

00:05:11.177 --> 00:05:13.279
on Front Street.

00:05:13.279 --> 00:05:15.548
It's a lot to take,

00:05:15.548 --> 00:05:17.550
a lot to take.

00:05:17.617 --> 00:05:21.020
And a little ray of sunshine was.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:23.423
I went up the back road today

00:05:24.857 --> 00:05:28.161
to see if my house was in ashes as well.

00:05:29.595 --> 00:05:31.698
And I pulled up around the corner,

00:05:32.699 --> 00:05:35.301
and it was smoky and stinky.

00:05:35.301 --> 00:05:37.203
From the fire.

00:05:37.537 --> 00:05:40.039
And there was my house standing.

00:05:41.341 --> 00:05:42.942
It did not burn down

00:05:42.942 --> 00:05:45.511
among all those burnt and down

00:05:46.713 --> 00:05:49.082
trees and power lines.

00:05:49.082 --> 00:05:49.515
And

00:05:51.217 --> 00:05:52.952
my house is still there.

00:05:52.952 --> 00:05:54.354
We wish you all the best.

00:05:54.354 --> 00:05:55.688
I know that

00:05:55.688 --> 00:05:57.824
so many of your fans will rally again,

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:00.827
rally around you in this time of need.

00:06:00.827 --> 00:06:02.595
So all the best to you, Ruby.

00:06:02.595 --> 00:06:03.863
To you and your family. Be well

00:06:05.098 --> 00:06:05.431
done.

00:06:05.431 --> 00:06:06.699
Thank you very much.

